.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH mdmc-list-msgs 1  "msgs " 
.SH NAME
mdmc\-list\-msgs \- List message\-ids
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBmdmc list msgs\fR [\fB\-\-config\fR] [\fB\-\-folders\fR] [\fB\-\-from\fR] [\fB\-\-last\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List message\-ids
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-config\fR \fI<CONFIG>\fR
Path to config.toml (default ~/.config/mdmc/config.toml)
.TP
\fB\-\-folders\fR \fI<FOLDERS>\fR
Filter to these folders (comma\-separated: [folders] name, drafts, sent, or <account>.drafts/sent)
.TP
\fB\-\-from\fR \fI<FROM>\fR
Restrict to messages whose sender matches this substring
.TP
\fB\-\-last\fR \fI<LAST>\fR
Only consider messages from the last N days (0 = no bound)
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print a JSON array instead of plain ids
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
